<section id="evidence" class="renderer-evidence">
  <h2>Evidence and scope</h2>
  <p>The HTML parser, DOM, CSS subset, layout, glyph positions, shared vector scene and link picker run in Lean WebAssembly. The browser host transports input, executes the generated WebGPU shader and displays its pixels. It does not use browser HTML layout for this output.</p>
  <p>The initial box and SVG embedding fixture matched the full CPU image and independently rendered original HTML in Chrome: 0 different pixels out of 7,680. Wrapped links, CSS color changes, text changes and reflow have separate browser checks. These local results are not a full HTML/CSS or WPT conformance score.</p>
